e requirement says \"arranged by their required mining level, lowest first\" — ties unspecified.\n\nMaybe the bug appears after starting a session or when the list has quest markers? Or maybe some ore rows are out of order lower down; we saw all 8. What about locked ores >50 hidden? Fine.\n\nWait, maybe the bug is that Rune Essence (Lv1) is listed *before* Copper/Tin but its XP is lower; \"lowest first\" could mean lowest XP? No, required mining level.\n\nCould there be a different mining screen accessible from the Mining skill card vs the Mine map location? Maybe the \"Mining screen\" has a list with more ores when opened via a different route (e.g., the Town mine or a \"Mining\" building). The area says \"the mining screen\". We used Skills > Mining. There might be another mining screen via \"Town\" or \"Expeditions\". Let's check the Town screen for a mine. It could show ore list with different sorting/state.\n\nAlso the gear chooser bug: We tested several slots and they matched inventory. Possible planted bug: the chooser candidate list is loaded from inventory once per app process but not each open? We saw new Basic Staff appear after purchase, so it does reload. Could be that the list is loaded from inventory *of the wrong category* for some slot, e.g., Weapon (Ranged) includes melee weapons or cape includes rings. We tested Body/Head/Cape/Weapon (Atk)/Weapon (Magic)/Legs. Let's test Shield, Ring, Necklace, Boots, Weapon (Ranged), Weapon (Strength). Also check candidate list for \"Body\" includes *Slayer Platebody* which has a \"Slayer\" requirement? It was equippable at Defense 45. Fine.\n\nPotential bug: candidate items loaded from inventory each open, but equipment items equipped are still in inventory; we saw Gilded (equipped) offered again. Maybe duplicate/equip bug. But re-equip didn't double stats.\n\nMaybe the issue is that the chooser doesn't show *quantity* and lets you equip items with quantity 0? Hmm.\n\nLet's test Ring slot: inventory has no rings