bars (requires 5 tin/copper) and wait ~5 min, then compare session summary +XP (31?) and skills XP. The dialog would show 5*6.2=31 exact (no formatting). Not about formatter.\n\nAlternatively, the per-action XP may be 6.2 stored float; each action adds 6.2 and display truncates. Then 5 bars = 31, dialog 31, correct. At 1 bar, un", "truncated": true}
